<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Azure Latch</Major>
    <Description>This macro for the game Azure Latch on Roblox performs various actions. First, he rainbow flicks, then he super runs into it, then he rainbow flicks, and then he slides into it, and then he kicks the ball up, and then headers it forward. Keep in mind that there may be errors, especially with high ping or incorrect mouse sensitivity settings. It is recommended to set the sensitivity in Roblox to 0.171 and DPI to 800. The optimal screen resolution is 1920 x 1080.
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
